# Outfit camera (R18): a chunky instant camera in the accent colour with the classic wedge profile (the top slopes
# back from a tall front), a glowing stripe running down the face, a big round steel lens standing proud, a
# signal-yellow flash (a thing the player uses) and a fresh print poking out of the slot at the bottom front.
name outfit_instantcam
grid 5
size 7 8 8
slot body SwatchAccent
slot stripe SwatchGlow
slot lens Steel
slot flash Signal
slot print Paint
slot dark Ink
poly 0 7 body 0,1 0,7 4,7 4,1
carve box 0 0 5 1 8 7
carve box 1 0 6 2 8 7
paint box 3 3 0 4 4 7 stripe
beam 4 4.5 3.5 5.6 4.5 3.5 1.8 lens
carve beam 5.2 4.5 3.5 5.6 4.5 3.5 0.9
box 2 1 6 4 3 7 flash
box 4 2 0 6 6 1 print
box 3 1 0 4 7 1 dark
pivot 2 4 0
